> - the loan company is seeking a completion certificate or disbursement;
> - installed work is unsafe, leaking, damaged, or unpermitted;
> - GHS says it has ceased operations, cannot obtain an installer, or cannot complete the job;
> - a deadline affects a tax credit, utility program, insurance, or property sale.
